                                "sense_id": "00a9d75d-8e3d-312a-8aab-7c54b8590544",
                                "text": "I am eternally indebted to Barbara Sawrey, who made me laugh the most along this journey. Everyone needs a wonderwall, and she's mine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "033170da-595a-45cc-a00f-fb74dd0d7627",
                                "sense_id": "00a9d75d-8e3d-312a-8aab-7c54b8590544",
                                "text": "Daphne Zablonski had become his wonderwall, the person he was drawn to when they were out with their friends and thought about in the hundreds of hours in between."
